        "topic": "Subject-Verb Agreement",
        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2000",
        "question_text": "<p>Select the correct verb to agree with the subject:<br><i>Neither the teacher nor the students <u>______</u> happy with the results.</i></p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>When subjects are joined by <i>nor</i>, the verb agrees with the <b>closer subject</b> (<i>students</i>), which is plural. Thus, the correct verb is <i>were</i>.</p>",
